SUMMARY:Atlanta Black Restaurant Week 2026
DESCRIPTION:« All Events\n 				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	Chef’s Night Out				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n		\n			August 10\n\n	\n\n	  @  \n\n\n6:00 PM\n\n		\n\n\n\n	\n	  -  \n\n8:00 PM\n\n\n\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n									Enjoy an unforgettable evening of networking\, food\, and drinks alongside Atlanta’s vibrant community of culinary business owners. Calling all chefs\, foodpreneurs\, and culinary industry professionals! In celebration of Black Restaurant Week\, we’re teaming up with Stella Artois\, Spot On\, and Portion to bring you a special edition of Chef’s Night Out. What’s on the menu: Connect with fellow chefs and industry professionalsExplore Small Business SolutionsEnjoy curated light bites and refreshing drinksVibe to music all evening  Perfect for: Restaurant Owners • Food Truck Operators • Bakers • Caterers • Private & Personal Chefs • Aspiring Culinary Entrepreneurs • Industry Professionals   								\n				\n				\n				\n									\n					\n						\n									RSVP REQUIRED\n					\n					\n				\n								\n				\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n\n	Categories:	\n		Atlanta	\n\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n	\n	Add to calendar	\n		\n	\n\n		\n			\n									\n	Google Calendar\n\n									\n	iCalendar\n\n									\n	Outlook 365\n\n									\n	Outlook Live\n\n							\n		\n\n		\n	\n\n				\n				\n					\n		\n				\n			\n						\n				\n					\n				\n				\n	\n			\n		The Upper Room			\n	\n	\n	\n\n1197 Peachtree St NE Apt 170\n	\n		\n		Atlanta\,\n\n\n	30361\n\n	United States\n\n\n\n\n	+ Google Map \n\n\n	\n					\n						\n	 \n\n\n	\n	 \n\n\n\n	\n\n		\n	\n				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					\n	\n		\n\n				Reunion Kickback	\n\n\n		\n	\n		Mix & Mingle: Small Business Networking Mixer
